@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Create post (replace authorId with a real user ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hello World",
  "content": "My first post using Rich Domain + Drizzle",
  "authorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Create second post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "DDD with Drizzle ORM",
  "content": "How to build rich domain models with Drizzle as persistence layer",
  "authorId": "773d135f-0682-4b75-af96-6aeb4b42cc1a"
}

### Get post by ID (replace with real ID after creation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List posts (no filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### List posts — filter by published status
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?filters={"published:equals":"true"}

### List posts — search in title/content
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?search=drizzle

### List posts — order by createdAt DESC + pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?orderBy=createdAt:desc&pagination={"limit":1}

### Update post title/content (replace ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "Updated content here"
}

### Publish post (replace ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/9ce0d7d0-d886-44ab-9529-d4c3bb2c28cd/publish

### Add tag to post (replace postId; tagId must exist in tags table)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tagId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Remove tag from post (replace postId and tagId)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tags/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
